   "en": "{07 16 00}It's still only {04 08 00}:{04 09 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}I hate {01 00 00 05 00}mornings, {01 00 00 05 00}\n{04 02 00}.",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Well, hello there{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 05 00}Dear {04 1f 00}...",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
