   "en": "{07 04 00}Hmm{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00} I hear the sound of\n{04 17 00} coming from\nsomewhere!\n{07 14 00}Hee hee,{01 00 00 0f 00} that must mean\nthat the night's beginning,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Good evening{01 07 00}!\nHow was your day,\n{04 1f 00}?",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
